WEBVTT

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.790
Let's turn this up a bit.

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:07.680
Understood.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:10.190
It's raised.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.330
This is clearly different 
from erosion by noro.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:17.770
I can't believe the fusion of aradama and 
the human body has progressed this far.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:20.650
President, urgent news!

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.590
I will listen to everything you have to say.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:39.840
Please do not involve the 
students or other staff.

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:48.640
They really took it this far.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:55.540
<i>The police have now charged 
into Minoseki Academy.</i>

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:59.020
<i>I repeat, the police have 
charged into Minoseki Academy.</i>

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:10.470
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:27.840
<b>Episode 10  Resolve for Tomorrow</b>

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:25.750
<i>Suspected of being involved with 
large-scale terrorist activities,</i>

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:27.780
<i>their respective prefectures' 
police have raided</i>

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:30.700
<i>Osafune Girls' School and Minoseki 
Academy of the five schools.</i>

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:32.890
<i>According to the authorities,</i>

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:36.240
<i>it appears that both schools had organized 
combat units consisting of Toji,</i>

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:38.890
<i>and were preparing to
commit acts of terrorism.</i>

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:42.820
<i>Police have arrested several school 
officials and are currently</i>

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.030
<i>investigating the situation.</i>

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:48.780
<b>Is the school all right?
They told us not to leave the dorms
What about Kanami and Mai?
They haven't come back yet
Who is the Origami family member?</b>

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:49.840
<i>Furthermore, the police are pursuing a woman 
who is a member of the Origami family</i>

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:54.540
<i>as a material witness who seems to be 
involuntarily involved in this case.</i>

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.420
So Osafune and Minoseki have been...

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:04.810
Heijou has also apparently 
been blockaded by the police.

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:06.860
What about our president?

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:15.040
I wonder what happened to 
Takako-san and the others.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:21.310
The Origami family has stepped up its
 surveillance of Mokusa members

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:25.820
currently in hiding, and now
 they're pinned down.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:29.010
We've been backed into a corner.

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:31.780
They've probably been 
arranging this for a while.

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:35.350
How did they know about the village?

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:38.800
There aren't any traces of any 
traitors within Mokusa,

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:42.480
and we've been continuing to erase 
information on that village

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.500
in real time from maps,
 the internet, and satellites.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:50.390
Rather than them knowing about it, 
they must've found it somehow.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:55.270
Our current location will 
probably be leaked to them, too.

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.890
The great aradama seems to be gaining power.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:03.650
The problem is what they're 
going to do next,

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:06.500
now that most of their opponents are gone.

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:08.690
They're not going to do something 
like 20 years ago, are they?

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:10.610
Would they just leave it at that?

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:16.000
The Origami family has collected more
 noro than was concentrated back then.

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:19.610
It's certainly a stalemate.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.750
We have no options left.

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:29.760
Are we still going to head 
to Osafune as planned?

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:36.010
Wouldn't it be better to escape overseas?

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:40.960
We have seized all those related to Mokusa.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.770
This will put an end to things for now.

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:46.820
It's hard to believe that the 
organization that troubled us so much

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.660
was devastated almost overnight.

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:53.030
They were disgustingly 
and brilliantly skilled.

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:55.910
Apparently the raid squad members

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:59.540
who went to the location had weapons 
to counteract a Toji's utsushi.

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:03.630
I can't believe they actually developed 
weapons to use against Toji.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:07.840
Even if it was to counteract Mokusa, 
they aren't showing the slightest mercy.

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:12.960
I wonder if Yukari-sama has been planning 
all of this ever since the incident

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:15.720
with Juujou Hiyori at the tournament.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:19.910
It feels like it might have 
been even before that.

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:25.230
Perhaps our failure was 
one of the catalysts, too.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.480
When will Yume be back?

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:32.820
As soon as control is handed 
over to the Toji from Ayanokouji.

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:36.510
She destroyed Mokusa's base all by herself?

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:40.170
I heard there were quite a few 
skilled Toji there as well.

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:42.200
Where's Yukari-sama?

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:44.930
Holding service at the shrine.

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:49.210
She's been shut up in there this whole time.

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:54.550
We stripped the Toji from Osafune, 
Minoseki, and Heijou of their right

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.090
to wear a sword and disarmed them.

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:59.910
Also, the Japan Coast Guard is 
still searching for Origami Akane—

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:00.750
Weak!

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:01.470
Huh?

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:05.330
Pressure the Japan Maritime Self-Defense 
Force to help with the search.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.850
But, ma'am...

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:10.980
Do you have any idea how 
much we've lent them so far?

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:13.610
Yes, ma'am! Please excuse me!

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:17.930
<i>Sayaka...</i>

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:20.880
<i>This is the only place where you belong.</i>

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:34.510
Mai?

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.260
I... want to fight.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.710
That was just too horrible.

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:49.850
Mai-chan...

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:55.140
Juujou-san, I've been thinking 
all this time about how you said

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:56.650
that I don't have a reason to fight.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:59.220
And about what I want to do.

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:01.910
I came here because I wanted 
to catch up with Kanami-chan,

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:05.410
and I couldn't leave Sayaka-chan on her own.

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.750
But that was it.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.990
I didn't really have any particular feelings

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.540
about Yukari-sama or how
 things would turn out.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:14.130
Mai...

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:19.360
But when I saw Satomi-san, 
Takako-san, and all the others

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:23.090
who looked after us in Mokusa fighting,

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:24.930
I thought about things again.

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:29.050
I didn't want to see the people 
around me get hurt ever again.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:36.870
I might not be able to 
save everyone on my own,

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:40.570
but I at least want to save those around me.

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.470
That's my reason for fighting!

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:53.470
Me, too.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:55.380
Sayaka-chan...

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.170
That's all I can do.

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:04.830
I've decided to avenge 
everyone from the village.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.290
There's no way I can stay out of this.

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:09.220
Wait a minute!

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:12.390
We're the only Toji left.

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:15.310
What are we supposed to do about this?

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:17.590
Get us off this ship.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:20.490
We will go make sure Takako-san 
and the others are safe.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.860
And then we'll return to Kamakura.

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:25.280
The enemy isn't alone.

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:29.660
There will be countless other hurdles 
before you reach the great aradama.

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:35.670
Juujou-san slipped through those hurdles
 and managed to strike Yukari-sama.

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:42.140
If that flat-chested girl can do it, 
then it shouldn't be impossible for us.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:51.510
Good grief...

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:53.190
Okay, then.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:57.940
The five of you alone aren't reliable,
 so I'll go with you, too.

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:05.450
Hiyori-chan, let's all go together!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.370
Are you sure?

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:12.620
Yes!

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:13.900
Yep.

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:20.400
Thank you.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:25.170
That was...

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:27.510
Someone's stomach, right?

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:28.720
Was it you, Hiyoyon?

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:29.560
No!

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.030
It was me...

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:34.300
We did forget to eat lunch, didn't we?

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:38.350
We can't fight on an empty stomach!

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:41.820
We have lots of submarine emergency rations!

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:44.350
They're not very good, though.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.970
Wait... what?

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:56.190
What?

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:57.080
What?!

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:01.330
Wh-What is this?

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.150
What?

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.250
What's going on?

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:29.530
This is...

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.250
What on earth is this?

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:37.500
What's wrong?

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:13.710
Nothing happened to you, did it, Grandpa?

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:14.920
No.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:18.830
Friedman-san, do you know anything?

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:24.010
This phenomenon only affects Toji.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:28.170
The same phenomenon has 
been confirmed before.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:30.760
Twenty years ago...

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:37.770
Most likely, there was some kind 
of huge change in the netherworld.

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:46.690
Then the great aradama appeared.

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:52.980
This is a national disaster.

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:55.200
We do not have a moment to waste.

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:58.580
We have to let people know 
about this right away.

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.580
How are we going to do that?

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.800
We will head directly to Yokosuka.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.170
Can you gather the press?

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:08.720
I see, so you're going to use mass media.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:13.690
If you show yourself now, you'll attract 
the attention of the whole country.

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:18.320
I will tell them all the truth, then.

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:23.450
About the things the Origami family 
has hidden and about Princess Tagitsu.

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:26.980
If it all becomes clear,

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:31.250
this may no longer be a problem 
just for this country alone.

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:36.160
But I don't think Origami Yukari
 will let that happen.

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:39.160
The worst case scenario could happen.

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:41.570
Whatever happens to me,

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:44.020
there are many other supporters in Mokusa.

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:47.460
You can't! There is no replacement for you!

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:52.320
Conversely, as long as you're safe,
 it won't be a checkmate.

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:53.220
But...

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:03.650
We will go our separate 
ways from Yokosuka, then.

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:05.980
What are you planning to do?

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:09.600
If we destroy Origami Yukari,
 it'll all be over.

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:12.280
They say the best defense is a good offense!

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.310
That's insane!

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.780
All of you?

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:25.130
It seems trying to stop you will be no use.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:30.190
You girls and Akane-sama, 
all you Toji are really...

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:32.990
Understood.

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:35.190
Please do so.

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:36.220
Akane-sama!

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:41.470
But please let me help you 
as much as I can at least.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:48.610
I will attract as many enemies as I 
can to make fighting easier for you.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:50.690
Akane-sama...

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:54.570
By the way, how are we 
going to reach Origami Yukari?

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:56.900
Huh? Well...

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:58.240
Hey.

00:14:58.590 --> 00:15:01.030
Can we use that thing?

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:03.840
Origami Akane has surrendered?

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:07.040
Why is she doing such a thing now?

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:11.920
And that phenomenon earlier... 
Just what on earth is going on?

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:14.720
There's no figuring that out right away,

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:18.430
but we can't just ignore Origami Akane.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.810
I wonder if we should head to Yokosuka, too.

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:27.120
We do not know what might happen, 
so we probably should not mobilize.

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:29.560
It might also be a trap.

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:32.030
But there is also the 
possibility that Origami Akane

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:35.820
will take advantage of this opportunity 
and join up with the Toji from Mokusa.

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:39.510
Then let's send out the Toji from Renpu.

00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:41.440
Contact President Takatsu.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:42.200
Yes, ma'am.

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:47.760
Um, I just got a report 
that President Takatsu

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:51.960
has taken the Renpu Toji and 
is already heading to Yokosuka.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:57.930
<i>Origami Akane...</i>

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:04.320
<i>She is a fool for rebelling against 
Yukari-sama despite being her younger sister.</i>

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:07.640
<i>I will definitely take care of this myself.</i>

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:16.750
I don't want the fun to start without me.

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:23.910
I see, so the six of you are going.

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:28.860
Yeah, everyone said they 
would fight with Hiyori-chan.

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:31.670
That's great.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:36.760
But Yukari is strong.

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:42.250
I know. I saw her handle an okatana once.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.010
Okay, then.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:48.930
Well, she's not as strong as me, at least.

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:50.640
What, really?

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:57.280
Hey, Kanami, don't you think 
being a Toji is great?

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:02.130
You protect people, and you're appreciated,

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:05.660
and you get to learn swordsmanship. 
It's the best, right?

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:06.950
Yeah!

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:10.160
The benefits are pretty spot-on, too.

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:12.670
That's your thing?

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.670
Kanami-chan, it's almost time.

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:18.160
Kanami-chan!

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:22.180
Morning.

00:17:22.610 --> 00:17:25.280
It's amazing that you can sleep right now.

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:29.370
Being able to fall asleep quickly anywhere 
is an important quality for a Toji.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:32.690
We're almost to Yokosuka, everyone.

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:33.980
Okay.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.990
Hey, after we defeat the great aradama,

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.400
do you wanna go get something 
really good to eat?

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:49.120
When that happens, it'll be my treat.

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:52.800
You've got a deep stomach, Ruippe!

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.690
You got that one wrong on purpose.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.410
All right!

00:17:57.410 --> 00:18:01.010
Hiyori-chan, we'll totally have 
chocolate mint ice cream for dessert.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:03.220
So we've settled on a full course meal?

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:06.990
Don't make it sound like chocolate
mint ice cream is all that matters!

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:09.470
Come back safe, everyone.

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:11.730
I'll search for a good place to eat.

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:13.230
Okay!

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:15.990
Juujou-san?

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:18.560
You should take command of us.

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:22.690
I'm sure we can make it to
 Origami Yukari with your guidance.

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:26.370
You have the ability.

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:28.740
Takako-senpai and the others said so, too.

00:18:29.110 --> 00:18:30.430
Juujou-san...

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:32.620
You can call me Hiyori.

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:36.000
Mai, I'm trusting you with my back.

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:38.510
Okay, Hiyori-chan!

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:09.360
Looks like we're valued pretty highly.

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:11.370
The press have made it, too.

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:13.920
As expected.

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:20.380
Someone has appeared on 
the deck of the submarine!

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:23.000
It appears to be a woman!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.000
Who is that?

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:25.990
Someone came out!

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:33.140
Everyone! I am Origami Akane.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:36.020
Please listen to what I have to say!

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:37.870
Origami Akane?

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.400
Get confirmation immediately!

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:44.000
Why is the media here?!

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.740
Where are the emergency preparations?

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:47.610
Over there!

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:52.120
Right now, a great danger
 looms over this country.

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:58.000
A disaster from 20 years ago... no,
 one worse than that is about to arise.

00:19:58.620 --> 00:20:03.130
<b>Emergency Live Broadcast
Yokosuka Bay</b>

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:03.130
<i>The main cause of the disaster 
twenty years ago, the great aradama,</i>

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:05.630
<b>You can do it!
Really?
Holy crap!
Is everything okay?
Oh, crap! Oh, crap!
Who is that?
She's prettier than I thought
Wait, is this for real?
I wanna be a Toji, too.
Aradama?
I can't see the video because of all of the comments.
Akane-tan so kyute!</b>

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:05.630
<i>is being revived again.</i>

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.690
<i>I am sure all of you Toji have felt it...</i>

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.390
<i>The strange phenomenon earlier.</i>

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:17.600
That is the precursor to the 
great aradama appearing.

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:19.890
We do not have a moment to waste!

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:23.900
The preparations are complete.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.160
C-Captain!

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:42.040
I beseech you to please lend me your strength!

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:55.510
This is not an attack!

00:20:56.020 --> 00:21:00.860
What we fired off just now is our hope!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:05.520
They are Storm Armor containers!

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:07.190
What is their expected landing point?

00:21:07.190 --> 00:21:10.030
Here! They're heading here!

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:19.710
Go back to headquarters immediately!

00:21:38.510 --> 00:21:40.350
They really did it.

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:39.840
<b>Next Episode  Gleam of Moonlight</b>
